Apply this domain algorithm to prepared evidence: Generate ordinary and adverse scenarios involving local exceptions, missing resources, and interrupted work. Replay the adapted procedure to detect ambiguous instructions, skipped prerequisites, or branches that cannot reach a safe terminal state.
For each field, return a value only when supported, source IDs, authority, one rejected alternative, and status established, disputed, unknown, or inapplicable. Preserve contrary evidence and distinguish observation from inference.
